1
00:00:00,090 --> 00:00:02,033
There's a galaxy in your sky...

2
00:00:02,075 --> 00:00:04,700
six times wider than the Moon.

3
00:00:04,730 --> 00:00:05,700
Never seen it?

4
00:00:05,730 --> 00:00:07,307
Your eyes are just...

5
00:00:07,307 --> 00:00:08,900
really bad at dim.

6
00:00:08,933 --> 00:00:10,967
They grab light for a blink.

7
00:00:11,019 --> 00:00:12,440
A camera grabs it

8
00:00:12,440 --> 00:00:13,700
for MINUTES...

9
00:00:13,738 --> 00:00:15,860
and the rest shows up.

10
00:00:15,960 --> 00:00:18,167
Line up full Moons across it...

11
00:00:18,195 --> 00:00:20,967
one, two, three...

12
00:00:21,005 --> 00:00:21,967
SIX.

13
00:00:22,004 --> 00:00:23,250
And that glow left

14
00:00:23,250 --> 00:00:25,767
two and a half million years ago...

15
00:00:25,810 --> 00:00:28,460
before people like us existed.

16
00:00:28,980 --> 00:00:30,067
Sorry, Moon.

